*Heading
Hash: FU7FqNXE, Date: 11/04/2026, Unit system: MM_TON_S_C
LHS_spk_ports_Z.pmx
Multi-zone Acoustics of single reflex speaker with ports:
- 1 sealed speaker x 2 Helmholtz ports.
- Z tests with internal speaker walls.
a) Use fluid damping curve from measurements.
b) Use curve velocity input wrt speaker measured freq response.
c) The spk VELOs only on back-spk surfs for this case.
d) Use Z = (50 * rho_c) on interior spk walls for Helmholz Q curve
e) bellmouth port end &
1D calc used for internal volume to represent hardware.
